 "geometry_notes": [
  "Origin at mid-soffit, y up. right_half_mm lists the right-hand outline; channel and U outlines run from the inner (void/top) centreline edge round the leg/web to the top and are mirrored as one ring.",
  "Channel girders CG60-CG100 (fitted-reconstruction): printed width chain, 15/1170/15 top recess, 50/150/leg depth chain and leg taper are exact; the side shear key, inner haunch rise and corner chamfers are not dimensioned and use common fitted values (bottom chamfers 5 x 5 mm, haunch 50 x 50 mm, key recess 35 mm with 25 mm rises). Residuals <=0.05% A and <=0.10% I.",
  "PC-I H90-H210, PC-U H120-H230, bulb tee H220 (estimate): only H, top/bottom widths and web are printed; see method notes per family. Their published A/I are reproduced by construction (PC-I, bulb tee) or within 1.3% (PC-U global fit). These are not manufacturer drawings."
 ],
